SUMMARY:Scarpa Shoe Demo
DESCRIPTION:Scarpa Shoe Demo is Coming to Boulderz! \nGet ready to test your next pair of climbing shoes and take advantage of exclusive event discounts at two upcoming Scarpa demos. \n📍 Boulderz Toronto\nWednesday\, November 18 | 5–8 PM \nCome try on Scarpa’s latest climbing shoes\, find your perfect fit\, and get expert advice before your next climb. \nHelp us spread the word\, bring your climbing crew\, and don’t miss out!
URL:https://boulderzclimbing.com/event/scarpademo/
LOCATION:Toronto\, 1444 Dupont St #16\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6P 4H3\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Event
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://boulderzclimbing.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/SCARPA-SH0E-DEMO.jpg
END:VEVENT
